  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>&#8477;</mi></math> be the function defined by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of <math><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></math> is _____</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>(Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#960;x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>",
